  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CISU Climate Fund (2018-2021) - Civil Society in Development&apos;s (CISU) Climate Fund 2018-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Civil Society (CS) in developing countries strengthened to advocate effectively and strategically on behalf of  poor and climate vulnerable groups: app. 235.000 people from vulnerable and marginalised target groups have increased their resilience to climate change
- National and community-level climate change policies, planning frameworks and information systems &#x2013; especially with a view to adaptation - are strengthened
- CISU Civil Society Fund effectively supporting Danish civil society climate action, and climate features strongly in the Civil Society Fund with relevant results.  Danish Civil Society Organisation&#x2019;s capacity to work with climate capacity building and advocacy with partners is strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
